 Definition X − mm X + mm Y − mm Y + mm Z − mm Z + mm Allowances added to the part bounding box on each side. Stock box (model): 64.00 × 34.00 × 15.00 mm WCS ORIGIN Stock box point Model box point Sketch point Explicit XYZ Pick on the stock box in the viewport X at Y at Z at Z direction Rotate about Z WCS origin (model): -2.000 , -2.000 , 13.000 mm Stock in setup: 64.00 × 34.00 × 15.00 mm · top Z 0.000 mm WORK OFFSETS First offset Duplicate parts offsets Posting one program repeats the toolpaths under that many consecutive offsets starting at the first (e.g. 3 from G54 → G54, G55, G56). Safe heights live on each operation; the post comes from this setup's machine/controller. Cancel Save changes"}],"unlabeled_controls":[{"id":"control-466-55","role":"button","surface":"dialogs/cam-setup-dialog"}]}}
